                            Use sexy tool to set sexy wallpeapers for X11

Compilation
============
```
# ./x build
```

Usage
=====
```
# ./xsetwall sexy_wallpaper.jpg
```

By default, the image is automatically scaled to fit the screen and centered.

> Fsr more informaton use `man ./xsetwall.1'

Meow :3

